"Zora devours Fennier and Ban-Li and nears both Tier 3 and grade C."
"It keeps fragments of their Concepts, so it wields shadow and fire that war inside it."
"Its core churns with fire, darkness, death and dream mana."
"It weaves dream mana and Psi into gentle mind control with persuasive offers."
"In a final rage it swells to twenty feet with jet-sized wings and a venomous death cloud."
"Its mantle of Nightmare shifts between armor, arrows and minions."
"It seeks the power in the world core behind the dome."
"Its heart is torn out and its core devoured."
